===Etymology===
From Proto-Uralic ''*karke'', itself an onomatopoeic word. Cognates include Estonian ''[[kurg]]'' and Northern Sami ''[[guorga]]''.<ref>Häkkinen, Kaisa (2005): ''Nykysuomen etymologinen sanakirja'', Juva: WSOY. ISBN 951-0-27108-X</ref>

===Noun===
{{fi-noun|kur|type=arki}}

# [[crane]] (''Grus grus'')
# a member of the family [[Gruidae]]

